      "decision": "BASE",
      "reason": "SOL drops the fanatics’ venomous, relentless attitude conveyed by their eyes alight with venom."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H023",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“Hidden from the world” keeps the concealment, and SOL preserves that they became another kind of monster."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H024",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "The context identifies the pierced person as a fanatic, and SOL clearly preserves the blade’s path through his chest and back."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H025",
      "decision": "BASE",
      "reason": "The source says survival is uncertain even with an immediate potion; “might not save him” instead suggests likely failure."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H026",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“Freeze” naturally conveys the Hunter’s body seizing up at the fanatic’s madness."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H027",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "The chill is retained in H028."
    },
